    "created_at": "2020-11-15T00:52:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-11-15T00:52:06Z",
    "body": "Seems like this is a known issue that was recently fixed on battery's end: https://github.com/svartalf/rust-battery/issues/76. We bumped to the version that's flagged as working on that issue (0.7.8) in #1852, which unfortunately happened one day after our most recent release (hence why it hasn't made it into a release yet).\r\n\r\nIf you'd like, you can try running `cargo install --git https://github.com/starship/starship.git` or grabbing [the latest tarball](https://github.com/starship/starship/archive/v0.46.2.tar.gz), changing `Cargo.toml`, and compiling it there. Otherwise, I believe this should be sorted out when we make our next release.\r\n\r\n",
